---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="How to reach AI For Global Good.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Contact</h1>

    <p>
      The best way to reach us today is through GitHub Issues on this project's repository. If you'd rather email, use the address below.
    </p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@aiforglobalgood.org">hello@aiforglobalgood.org</a> <span class="text-muted">(coming soon — until then, please open a GitHub issue)</span>
    </p>

    <h2>On the web</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/">github.com/aiforglobalgood</a> <span class="text-muted">(to be registered)</span></li>
      <li>Mastodon, Bluesky, LinkedIn: coming soon</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>For journalists</h2>
    <p>
      We're a founding-stage initiative. Please don't describe us as a registered foundation, a UN partner, or a representative of the field — none of which we are. For who we are and are not, see the <a href="/charter">Charter</a> and the <a href="/about#independence">independence note</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
